<h1 style="font-size:22px; margin:16px 0 8px;">Welcome to the team<%= @user.first_name.present? ? ", #{@user.first_name}" : "" %>!</h1>

<p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#4f535a;">
  Your Beauty @ Your Door staff account is ready. You'll sign in with:
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; color:#101217;"><%= @user.email %></p>

<p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#4f535a;">
  First, choose your password. This link works once and expires in <%= @expires_in_days %> days.
</p>

<a href="<%= @reset_url %>" class="btn">Set my password</a>

<p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#4f535a;">
  Then sign in to the BAYD Staff app on your phone to see your jobs. You'll get a separate invite to
  install it. You can also sign in on the web at <a href="<%= @sign_in_url %>"><%= @sign_in_url %></a>.
</p>

<p class="muted">
  If the link has expired, use "Forgot password" on the sign-in page with the email above.
</p>
